      "author": {
        "id": 1297255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T21:55:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Patrick,\n\nWe are following the pattern of FEATURE_IPSEC_TUNNELS.\n\nThe main purpose of FEATURE_IPSEC_TUNNEL_MIGRATION is to gate a new Android feature that requires kernel changes. Because we cannot force old devices to update kernels, we can only require the new feature to be available on new devices, and at the same time allow OEMs to opt in the support on old devices.\n\nThus we use this FEATURE_IPSEC_TUNNEL_MIGRATION to indicate the kernel support (and feature availability). Specifically, we enforce (via CTS) devices with VSR API \u003e\u003d U to have the feature flag, and allow older devices to add the feature flag xml when they update their kernels. At the same time, apps can find out the availability of the Android feature by checking the existence of this feature flag.",
      "parentUuid": "c95db808_e57baa5e",
      "revId": "43c8fd2aa1a2c2c90403f5b7895cc71d627a608e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "626d9ea0_96297232",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-11T06:55:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding is that we do expect apps to possibly filter delivery based on the availability of this feature. Some VPNs will only be available to devices with FEATURE_IPSEC_TUNNELS. Among these :\n- Some VPNs will work whether TUNNEL_MIGRATION is supported or not, but might change their behavior depending\n- Some VPNs may not work without TUNNEL_MIGRATION and may want to only install on devices where this feature is present.\n\nGiven the above, I believe this is correct API. Accordingly giving API+2, but Yan please convince Patrick for OWNERS :)",
      "parentUuid": "fa52d3d3_33ab8f00",
      "revId": "43c8fd2aa1a2c2c90403f5b7895cc71d627a608e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
